    "detailed_description": "A short 3D platforming adventure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay as Tichi as she runs and jumps through a variety of levels. Solve challenges, collect crystals, and go fast for the best possible time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTichi3D follows a light narrative, but is mostly focused on the platforming. Talk to NPC's for fun dialogue, then put your skills to the test in the platforming levels to unlock fun rewards<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Features-<br />\r\n- Short game perfect to beat in one sitting<br />\r\n- 6 worlds to explore across 3 distinct themes<br />\r\n- Memorable levels and music<br />\r\n- 1 large scale boss fight<br />\r\n- Hub area with unlockable trophies<br />\r\n- High replayability<br />\r\n- Low poly aesthetic",
